# Akamu ACME — Certificate Profiles
Output docs/gifs/14-acme-profiles.mp4
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# ACME Certificate Profiles — akamu-rsa.cert-lab.local"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "./lab acme-profiles -p rsa"
Enter
Sleep 4s
